{"title":"The Howling Sirocco","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">The Howling Sirocco is a named <a href=\"#/monster/sirocco\">Sirocco</a> seen at level 40.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Where to find The Howling Sirocco</h2>\n      \n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Storm-Buried%20Caravan\">Storm-Buried Caravan</a></li></ul>\n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"the-howling-sirocco\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra\"><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">33 drops</span></div></div></div>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/09b45d3b4d34c05d314b.webp\" alt=\"\"></div><h3>The Howling Sirocco</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Kind</th><td><a href=\"#/monster/sirocco\">Sirocco</a></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>40</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>582</td></tr><tr><th>Seen</th><td>4 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}